 e\, come explore the world of Pokémon\, learn how to play the trading car
 d game\, discover the newest cards and sets\, and enjoy friendly matches w
 ith other trainers.\nFor ages 7-12 only (Younger siblings are welcome to a
 ttend with a caregiver\; quiet activities such as coloring may be provided
 )\n*For all registered Children's programs at Malvern\, there is a grace p
 eriod of 10 minutes. After the first 10 minutes of a program\, spots will 
 be given to waiting customers.*\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe perso
 nal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library un
 der the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The inf
 ormation will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery a
 nd evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your information ca
 n be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\,
  789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Malvern\, Community Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a022489177319280018fd66
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
